{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Ever tried rowing a barrel down a river? It's harder than it looks.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <i>Row Away</i>, you\u2019ll paddle your way through winding and rocky rivers, and sudden currents\u2014all from inside a floating barrel. It\u2019s part chill river adventure, part test of patience and perseverance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">One moment you\u2019re soaking in the calm sounds of nature. The next, you\u2019re bouncing off a boulder and spinning helplessly downstream. The controls are simple, but mastering them? Not so much.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a cozy-rage game. It\u2019s peaceful, frustrating, funny\u2014and somehow relaxing all at once.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Row through a variety of meticulously designed river terrains</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810990/extras/2025-06-10_09-06-19.gif?t=1751167985\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810990/extras/2025-06-10_09-06-19_2.gif?t=1751167985\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810990/extras/2025-06-10_09-06-19_3.gif?t=1751167985\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810990/extras/2025-06-10_09-06-19_4.gif?t=1751167985\" /></div></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Chill, nature-inspired sound design and visuals</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Simple controls: <i>left-click to 